PART 11: ATTENDANCE IMPLEMENTATION
==================================

Supported states:

NOT_MARKED
PRESENT
ABSENT
LEFT

NOT_MARKED is a display state when no attendance document exists.

Do not automatically mark unmarked students absent.

Only the admin can record attendance.

A PRESENT record must include a valid arrival timestamp.

An ABSENT record must not include arrival or departure timestamps.

LEFT is permitted only after PRESENT.

A LEFT transition must preserve the original arrival timestamp and record a valid departure timestamp.

Departure must not be earlier than arrival.

Calculate ON_TIME or LATE using the class session's scheduled start time and grace-period snapshot.

Use a documented, consistent comparison boundary.

Do not allow parents to modify attendance.

Do not silently overwrite attendance.

Use an audited correction workflow.

Provide attendance history and percentage reports.

Exclude NOT_MARKED sessions from the attendance percentage denominator.

Preserve historical attendance.

Do not implement automatic 60-day deletion.

